{"about_the_game":"Take to the skies with up to three friends for non-stop dogfighting action. Designed for playing on a big screen locally (online multiplayer is also supported), <strong>Bip</strong> is a side-on arcade experience.  Fight against each other, singly or in teams, or band together to take on the bot pilots. <br><br>Use a joypad to control your biplane, experiencing the joy of flight and the intensity of air-to-air combat, reduced to the simplicity of two dimensions.  Gain a height advantage on your opponents before swooping down upon them, outmanoeuvre them by performing an Immelmann or a Split-S, but try not to crash because you stalled while climbing!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1285200?t=1771584860","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771584860","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285200/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771584860","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285200/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771584860","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Take to the skies with up to three friends for non-stop dogfighting action. Designed for playing on a big screen locally (online multiplayer is also supported), <strong>Bip</strong> is a side-on arcade experience.  Fight against each other, singly or in teams, or band together to take on the bot pilots. <br><br>Use a joypad to control your biplane, experiencing the joy of flight and the intensity of air-to-air combat, reduced to the simplicity of two dimensions.  Gain a height advantage on your opponents before swooping down upon them, outmanoeuvre them by performing an Immelmann or a Split-S, but try not to crash because you stalled while climbing!","developers":["Iain King"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1285200/header.jpg?t=1771584860","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Bip is an original work inspired by Biplane Duel / Salmon Pink Max.  Neither it not its publisher/developer are in any way affiliated with those titles or their creator, Peter Mason.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1285200/290542/fa19d6ef978f00da40843c6fc6ccbcb8c35367fe/1751214983/dash_av1.mpd?t=1591460489","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1285200/290542/fa19d6ef978f00da40843c6fc6ccbcb8c35367fe/1751214983/dash_h264.mpd?t=1591460489","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1285200/290542/fa19d6ef978f00da40843c6fc6ccbcb8c35367fe/1751214983/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1591460489","id":256788036,"name":"Gameplay Demo June 2020","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256788036/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1591460489"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/sto